
====================================================================================================
S1. The asymptotic class -- the framework is alpha = 1
====================================================================================================
  interpolation                        lim x(1-mu)   lim x^2(1-mu)   alpha
  framework  (sqrt(1+4x^2)-1)/(2x)             1/2              oo       1
  'simple'   x/(1+x)                             1              oo       1
  'standard' x/sqrt(1+x^2)                       0             1/2       2
  [OK] the framework's mu has lim x(1-mu) = 1/2, i.e. alpha = 1 with A = 1/2 -- the SAME class as the 'simple' mu, NOT the alpha = 2 'standard' one

