  alt rho_total: bare anomaly A = a0/2 = 5.6500e-11 m/s^2 (independent of g_bar)
  planet      g_bar/a0  arcsec/century   vs allowance
  Mercury    3.502e+08          0.7684     1921x over
  Venus      1.003e+08          1.0501               
